==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|за-|ходи́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|заходи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-заходить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|заходи́ть|impf|pf=зайти́}}

# to [[go]] (to see), to [[come in]] (to see, etc.), to [[call]], to [[drop in]]
# to [[pick up]], to [[fetch]]
# {{lb|ru|nautical}} to [[call]] at, to [[enter]] (a port)
# {{lb|ru|nautical}} to [[get]], to [[advance]]
# {{lb|ru|nautical}} to [[pass]], to [[draw out]]
# {{lb|ru|aviation}} to [[approach]]
# {{lb|ru|military}} to [[outflank]]
# {{lb|ru|military}} to [[turn]], to [[disappear]], to [[go]] behind
# {{lb|ru|astronomy}} to [[set]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в|В]] [[Хе́льсинки]] [[со́лнце]] '''захо́дит''' [[в]] [[по́лночь]].|The sun '''sets''' at midnight in Helsinki.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|4c|заходи́ть}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|посеща́ть}}, {{l|ru|загля́дывать}}
* {{l|ru|забира́ться}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|захо́д|g=m}}
* {{l|ru|заходи́ться}}, {{l|ru|зайти́сь}}
